Assignment Submission & Review System
1)Assigment class-Details about the assignment assigned description and deadline
2)Student class-Student details
3)Mentor class-Mentor details
4)Submission class-Details about the submitted task,status and date.
5)Review class-Grades and feedback from the mentor 

1) Assignment Class
class Assignment {
    int assignmentId;
    String title;
    String description;
    String deadline;
    String subject;

    void createAssignment(int id, String t, String d, String dl, String s) {
        assignmentId = id;
        title = t;
        description = d;
        deadline = dl;
        subject = s;
    }

    void displayAssignment() {
        System.out.println("Assignment ID: " + assignmentId);
        System.out.println("Title: " + title);
        System.out.println("Deadline: " + deadline);
        System.out.println("Subject: " + subject);
    }
}

